WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:59.489
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:59.759 --> 01:01.439
Driver, are we going the wrong way?

3
01:01.920 --> 01:03.240
Aren't we taking the highway back to Lacheng?

4
01:03.679 --> 01:04.799
Aren't you in a hurry?

5
01:05.120 --> 01:05.879
I'm taking a shortcut.

6
01:06.239 --> 01:06.680
Don't worry.

7
01:06.959 --> 01:07.680
I know this route.

8
01:08.040 --> 01:08.439
Trust me.

9
01:10.719 --> 01:11.359
Thanks.

10
03:20.479 --> 03:22.639
Dad, I killed you.

11
03:34.919 --> 03:36.520
Dad, aren't you eating?

12
03:36.680 --> 03:38.800
Daddy's got a big driving job today

13
03:38.800 --> 03:39.840
to make some good money.

14
03:40.080 --> 03:42.159
When I get back, I'll buy you a big toy gun.

15
03:42.240 --> 03:43.319
Yay!

16
03:43.400 --> 03:44.400
Dad!

17
03:44.439 --> 03:46.159
You're back!

18
03:46.280 --> 03:46.960
You bet!

19
03:47.199 --> 03:48.439
We've got to spend New Year's together.

20
03:49.039 --> 03:49.560
Okay!

21
03:49.560 --> 03:50.159
Go on inside.

22
03:52.080 --> 03:53.080
Come back quick!

23
03:53.360 --> 03:53.759
Will do.

24
03:56.080 --> 03:56.919
Watch your step, don't fall!

25
03:58.319 --> 03:58.919
Got you!

26
04:00.719 --> 04:01.439
Daddy!

27
04:02.560 --> 04:04.800
Grandma told me to give you a meat bun.

28
04:08.400 --> 04:08.800
Thanks.

29
04:09.400 --> 04:10.000
Head on back now.

30
04:21.800 --> 04:23.120
Dad.

31
04:24.120 --> 04:27.120
Grandma told me to give you a meat bun.

32
04:46.800 --> 04:47.839
Why are you back?

33
04:50.720 --> 04:51.639
What's wrong?

34
04:54.959 --> 04:55.920
Did you mess up?

35
04:58.399 --> 04:59.279
Say something!

36
05:05.839 --> 05:06.959
My dad wasn't drinking.

37
05:14.040 --> 05:15.279
I looked into it.

38
05:16.759 --> 05:17.839
My dad wasn't drinking.

39
07:07.600 --> 07:08.519
Go, Sister Xuemei!

40
07:33.040 --> 07:34.839
Died right on the bench.

41
07:39.079 --> 07:39.600
I had no idea.

42
07:39.600 --> 07:40.399
Thought she was just asleep.

43
07:47.439 --> 07:48.240
Where's her bag?

44
07:50.920 --> 07:52.560
Liu Xuemei's bag is gone.

45
08:01.680 --> 08:02.560
I'll get it to you later.

46
08:09.279 --> 08:10.120
As for Cao Jun's case,

47
08:10.360 --> 08:11.120
the investigation is fully wrapped up.

48
08:11.839 --> 08:14.920
It's also confirmed that the deaths of Ma and Qian

49
08:15.120 --> 08:16.959
have no connection to Cao Jun's case.

50
08:18.160 --> 08:20.600
We need to readjust our investigation.

51
08:21.720 --> 08:23.160
According to Chen Qingchun's confession,

52
08:23.519 --> 08:25.439
the night Qian Yichuan was attacked,

53
08:25.759 --> 08:27.319
at Old Workers' Haven,

54
08:28.120 --> 08:29.519
Cheng Youtian and Liu Tieping

55
08:29.759 --> 08:31.680
had a fierce argument with Qian Yichuan.

56
08:32.639 --> 08:33.799
When the crime took place,

57
08:34.039 --> 08:35.200
where were the master and apprentice?

58
08:36.120 --> 08:37.399
Chen Qingchun said

59
08:37.679 --> 08:39.039
that after Qian Yichuan left,

60
08:39.120 --> 08:40.279
everyone parted on bad terms,

61
08:40.960 --> 08:42.480
leaving only the master and apprentice.

62
08:43.279 --> 08:45.159
The day Qian Yichuan fell to his death,

63
08:45.639 --> 08:46.720
did the two of them

64
08:47.080 --> 08:48.039
have an alibi?

65
08:48.559 --> 08:50.679
Based on our recent findings,

66
08:50.879 --> 08:51.679
Liu Tieping,

67
08:51.679 --> 08:52.759
aside from work,

68
08:53.240 --> 08:55.480
went straight to Old Workers' Haven

69
08:56.080 --> 08:57.679
to keep his master company.

70
08:58.320 --> 09:01.279
Besides grocery shopping and cooking,

71
09:01.480 --> 09:03.399
they have almost no outside contact.

72
09:03.919 --> 09:06.840
So they're each other's alibis.

73
09:07.440 --> 09:08.279
Does that even count as proof?

74
09:09.440 --> 09:10.120
Keep digging.

75
09:11.240 --> 09:12.480
Gao Xuelin, Xiao Wu,

76
09:13.279 --> 09:16.480
keep your eyes glued to Cheng and Liu.

77
09:16.720 --> 09:18.720
Report anything suspicious immediately.

78
09:19.200 --> 09:19.679
Copy that.

79
09:19.799 --> 09:20.399
Captain Han,

80
09:20.799 --> 09:21.600
get a team together

81
09:22.159 --> 09:23.440
and reinvestigate

82
09:23.960 --> 09:24.799
Ma Guowen

83
09:25.080 --> 09:26.200
and Qian Yichuan's backgrounds.

84
09:26.279 --> 09:26.679
Understood.

85
09:27.000 --> 09:27.440
Xiao Cai,

86
09:28.039 --> 09:29.080
question Tu Chunyan again

87
09:29.399 --> 09:30.519
and see if she has any new leads.

88
09:31.000 --> 09:31.519
Will do.

89
09:45.960 --> 09:47.159
Before Ma Guowen beats us to it,

90
09:47.159 --> 09:48.120
let's buy the factory ourselves.

91
09:48.399 --> 09:48.759
Buy it?

92
09:48.960 --> 09:50.200
Just the few of us?

93
09:50.200 --> 09:51.399
Where are we gonna get that kind of money?

94
09:51.399 --> 09:52.120
We'll figure something out!

95
09:52.120 --> 09:53.000
We can reach out to— Saved these just for you.

96
09:53.000 --> 09:54.039
—people we know! Homemade dumplings.

97
09:54.039 --> 09:55.039
People we can trust!

98
09:55.159 --> 09:55.919
Will that really work?

99
09:55.919 --> 09:56.679
What are you doing?

100
09:56.759 --> 09:59.240
Didn't you say a single spark can start a prairie fire?

101
09:59.240 --> 10:00.120
Prairie fire my ass.

102
10:00.120 --> 10:00.879
Careful, it's hot.

103
10:01.120 --> 10:03.320
Before we even sort it out, Ma Guowen will wipe us out.

104
10:04.960 --> 10:05.679
Eat slowly.

105
10:06.840 --> 10:07.639
They're still warm.

106
10:08.639 --> 10:09.360
Have a few more.

107
10:11.240 --> 10:12.000
What are you doing?!

108
10:13.000 --> 10:13.440
Get in here!

109
10:13.480 --> 10:13.919
Who's that?

110
10:15.360 --> 10:15.799
Wait—

111
10:16.360 --> 10:17.159
she was outside just now,

112
10:17.159 --> 10:18.320
recording everything you said.

113
10:18.519 --> 10:19.000
What's going on?

114
10:19.039 --> 10:20.480
Why... why are you recording this?

115
10:20.639 --> 10:21.240
Who sent you?

116
10:48.759 --> 10:54.639
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

117
10:57.559 --> 10:58.759
He kissed Shunzi!

118
10:58.759 --> 10:59.960
Why the hell are you kissing me?!

119
11:00.679 --> 11:02.120
He kissed Shunzi, so I kissed the wrong guy!

120
11:03.399 --> 11:04.159
Shunzi!

121
11:04.480 --> 11:05.240
What the hell are you doing?

122
11:05.639 --> 11:06.840
Alright, knock it off, you guys!

123
11:18.240 --> 11:19.480
He kissed Shunzi.

124
11:20.679 --> 11:21.440
Shunzi!

125
11:21.759 --> 11:22.519
What are you doing?

126
11:22.559 --> 11:23.320
Alright, that's enough.

127
11:40.240 --> 11:41.000
Officer Han,

128
11:41.559 --> 11:42.360
I need to talk to you.

129
11:44.559 --> 11:46.080
I went through that unused footage from back then,

130
11:46.919 --> 11:48.080
and found a few spots

131
11:48.759 --> 11:50.159
that might be leads for your case.

132
11:52.200 --> 11:53.039
The exact timecodes...

133
11:53.080 --> 11:54.120
I've already marked them.

134
11:55.759 --> 11:56.559
I'll bring them over to you.

135
11:58.759 --> 12:00.440
This is our report regarding

136
12:00.679 --> 12:02.840
the three brutal homicides

137
12:02.960 --> 12:05.120
at Lapi Brewery this month.

138
12:05.399 --> 12:07.600
The killer in Cao Jun's case

139
12:07.600 --> 12:08.480
has already been apprehended.

140
12:08.759 --> 12:09.559
The Ma Guowen case

141
12:09.679 --> 12:12.759
shares the exact same MO as Qian Yichuan's.

142
12:13.039 --> 12:15.200
Could it be the work of the same killer?

143
12:15.799 --> 12:18.039
After screening the social ties of both victims,

144
12:18.159 --> 12:19.840
three prime suspects have emerged.

145
12:20.200 --> 12:20.840
First,

146
12:21.120 --> 12:23.120
former brewery workshop director Cheng Youtian.

147
12:23.360 --> 12:23.879
Second,

148
12:23.879 --> 12:25.559
former propaganda section chief Zhao Haipeng.

149
12:25.799 --> 12:26.320
Third,

150
12:26.600 --> 12:27.960
brewery worker Liu Tieping.

151
12:28.639 --> 12:29.600
All three of them

152
12:29.679 --> 12:30.799
were involved back then

153
12:30.799 --> 12:32.559
in the auction of Lapi Brewery.

154
12:32.720 --> 12:33.879
They also meet the key condition

155
12:33.919 --> 12:36.720
of being familiar with the crime scenes.

156
12:37.919 --> 12:38.960
After Ma Guowen was murdered,

157
12:38.960 --> 12:41.600
all three showed up at a gathering of former co-workers.

158
12:42.519 --> 12:44.440
According to Chen Qingchun's confession,

159
12:44.879 --> 12:46.960
before his death, Qian Yichuan had a heated clash

160
12:47.000 --> 12:48.799
with the master and apprentice,

161
12:48.799 --> 12:50.960
Cheng Youtian and Liu Tieping.

162
12:51.600 --> 12:54.960
Qian Yichuan also hurled insults at Liu Xuemei.

163
12:56.480 --> 12:56.960
That's all.

164
12:58.720 --> 12:59.320
Captain Cheng.

165
13:00.000 --> 13:00.799
Shen Leshui

166
13:00.799 --> 13:01.960
brought over some tapes

167
13:01.960 --> 13:03.799
of unused footage shot back then.

168
13:04.279 --> 13:05.679
From these tapes,

169
13:05.720 --> 13:06.799
we found a few clues as well.

170
13:07.120 --> 13:07.759
First off,

171
13:08.320 --> 13:10.279
she mentioned that when Liu Xuemei went to the auction,

172
13:10.279 --> 13:11.240
she carried a handbag.

173
13:11.960 --> 13:14.159
Yet where she froze to death, the bag was missing.

174
13:14.840 --> 13:15.240
Also,

175
13:15.840 --> 13:16.360
Xiao Wu,

176
13:16.840 --> 13:17.559
play the clip.

177
13:18.039 --> 13:18.759
Three minutes and six seconds.

178
13:20.200 --> 13:20.600
Look.

179
13:21.120 --> 13:22.159
Shen Leshui told me

180
13:22.200 --> 13:24.080
Liu Tieping shot this footage.

181
13:24.559 --> 13:25.960
And throughout this shot,

182
13:25.960 --> 13:27.159
he only filmed Liu Xuemei.

183
13:29.679 --> 13:31.720
Play from ten minutes and fifteen seconds.

184
13:32.279 --> 13:32.639
Okay.

185
13:32.960 --> 13:33.679
Pause it here.

186
13:33.759 --> 13:34.080
Okay.

187
13:34.960 --> 13:35.519
Right here.

188
13:36.159 --> 13:37.159
Everyone, take a look.

189
13:37.480 --> 13:40.080
Look at how Liu Tieping stares at Liu Xuemei.

190
13:41.679 --> 13:42.600
In the unused footage

191
13:42.759 --> 13:45.279
that Shen Leshui gave us,

192
13:45.519 --> 13:47.639
there are many looks like this.

193
13:47.879 --> 13:48.799
At first,

194
13:49.720 --> 13:52.159
the entire focus of our investigation

195
13:52.399 --> 13:53.399
was placed on

196
13:53.759 --> 13:56.320
finding Liu Xuemei's lover in Qingzhou.

197
13:56.919 --> 13:59.799
After Chen Yuan's footage theft case was solved,

198
14:00.000 --> 14:03.080
it proved he was indeed Liu Xuemei's lover.

199
14:04.559 --> 14:05.799
However, in the murders

200
14:05.799 --> 14:08.679
of Ma Guowen and Qian Yichuan,

201
14:08.919 --> 14:11.320
Chen Yuan had solid alibis for both.

202
14:11.559 --> 14:13.799
That cleared Chen Yuan of suspicion.

203
14:14.480 --> 14:15.960
And our leads hit a dead end.

204
14:16.600 --> 14:17.399
Luckily, Shen Leshui

205
14:17.399 --> 14:18.879
brought us the tapes of unused footage.

206
14:19.360 --> 14:20.480
In these tapes,

207
14:20.600 --> 14:21.879
someone very inconspicuous

208
14:21.960 --> 14:24.559
finally came into our sights.

209
14:25.159 --> 14:27.039
That man is Liu Tieping.

210
14:27.720 --> 14:28.320
As for him,

211
14:28.360 --> 14:29.279
he was involved in all the preparations

212
14:29.320 --> 14:31.519
for the factory auction back then.

213
14:31.720 --> 14:34.600
Plus, he knew the victims well.

214
14:35.000 --> 14:35.799
With the victims,

215
14:35.799 --> 14:38.159
he had deep social ties and emotional baggage.

216
14:38.440 --> 14:39.360
Most importantly,

217
14:40.399 --> 14:43.600
he harbored romantic feelings for Liu Xuemei.

218
14:44.440 --> 14:47.120
When he learned she froze to death,

219
14:47.639 --> 14:49.720
and that people were calling her a traitor,

220
14:49.720 --> 14:50.960
he didn't believe it.

221
14:51.840 --> 14:54.159
He had a motive to kill Ma Guowen.

222
14:55.000 --> 14:56.279
As for the victim Qian Yichuan,

223
14:56.279 --> 14:58.679
When he was alive, he firmly believed she was a traitor.

224
14:59.960 --> 15:02.480
And during gatherings with old coworkers,

225
15:02.519 --> 15:04.399
he repeatedly insulted Liu Xuemei in public.

226
15:05.600 --> 15:06.799
Liu Tieping was present every time.

227
15:08.320 --> 15:09.159
This could also be

228
15:09.159 --> 15:11.200
his motive to kill Qian Yichuan.

229
15:11.240 --> 15:12.759
Of course, this is just speculation.

230
15:13.879 --> 15:14.879
As for Liu Tieping,

231
15:15.279 --> 15:16.039
he's an orphan.

232
15:16.559 --> 15:18.480
Cheng Youtian raised him.

233
15:19.080 --> 15:19.879
When he grew up,

234
15:19.879 --> 15:21.960
Cheng Youtian brought him into Lapi Brewery.

235
15:22.960 --> 15:24.679
Liu Tieping took Cheng Youtian as his mentor.

236
15:25.679 --> 15:27.440
The two of them share an extremely close bond.

237
15:29.519 --> 15:30.360
Following this logic,

238
15:31.159 --> 15:32.960
we can't rule out they committed the crimes together.

239
15:33.879 --> 15:34.240
Captain Han,

240
15:34.840 --> 15:36.120
put surveillance on both of them immediately.

241
15:36.399 --> 15:37.039
Make the arrangements.

242
15:37.559 --> 15:38.200
Yes, sir.

243
15:39.399 --> 15:40.080
Thirty-two.

244
15:40.279 --> 15:41.360
Just make it thirty, bro. It's freezing out!

245
15:45.360 --> 15:45.720
Here you go.

246
15:45.879 --> 15:46.480
Thanks.

247
15:47.440 --> 15:48.240
Getting some fish, brother?

248
15:48.559 --> 15:49.320
Come have some noodles!

249
15:49.360 --> 15:50.000
Sure, sure.

250
16:29.759 --> 16:30.600
I just checked around.

251
16:31.639 --> 16:32.240
There's no back door.

252
16:32.840 --> 16:33.919
Didn't I tell you?

253
16:33.960 --> 16:34.679
It's a semi-basement.

254
16:34.960 --> 16:35.720
There's only that one door.

255
16:36.120 --> 16:37.240
Just keep an eye on that door.

256
16:37.399 --> 16:38.200
They can't even crawl out.

257
16:39.039 --> 16:39.440
Thanks.

258
16:50.759 --> 16:51.879
Here, have some pickled cabbage.

259
16:52.519 --> 16:53.440
Thanks. Thank you, boss.

260
16:53.440 --> 16:54.080
Thank you, boss.

261
16:54.120 --> 16:54.879
Taste all right?

262
16:54.960 --> 16:55.639
Really good. Really good, authentic.

263
16:55.639 --> 16:56.519
Real authentic.

264
17:18.880 --> 17:19.599
Master Cheng.

265
17:21.799 --> 17:22.480
Shunzi!

266
17:23.200 --> 17:24.599
What a rare sight!

267
17:25.200 --> 17:26.039
What, not welcome?

268
17:26.039 --> 17:26.640
I'll take off then.

269
17:27.319 --> 17:27.839
Come on, don't do that.

270
17:28.960 --> 17:29.599
Look right here.

271
17:30.839 --> 17:32.160
You say the days are long,

272
17:32.279 --> 17:33.240
and I'll pour the drinks.

273
17:33.640 --> 17:34.079
Bring a bottle!

274
17:34.759 --> 17:35.839
Tieping, bring some drinks!

275
17:36.880 --> 17:37.319
Tieping!

276
17:37.319 --> 17:38.279
Aren't you working today?

277
17:40.599 --> 17:41.279
Didn't the factory go bust?

278
17:41.279 --> 17:41.960
What job would I go to?

279
17:43.640 --> 17:44.519
I'll get it myself. I've got it.

280
17:44.799 --> 17:45.440
Shunzi,

281
17:46.079 --> 17:47.039
what would you like to eat?

282
17:47.880 --> 17:49.200
Just some handmade noodles.

283
17:49.559 --> 17:50.319
Alright.

284
17:51.359 --> 17:51.880
Also...

285
17:52.599 --> 17:54.039
Throw in two cold dishes on the house.

286
17:55.119 --> 17:55.799
Thanks, Master Cheng.

287
17:58.720 --> 17:59.319
Just leave it there.

288
17:59.359 --> 17:59.960
Tieping,

289
18:00.519 --> 18:01.559
come give me a hand.

290
18:03.279 --> 18:03.920
Coming.

291
18:58.240 --> 18:58.839
Tieping,

292
19:00.000 --> 19:01.200
don't go out these days.

293
19:01.839 --> 19:03.240
And don't contact anyone either.

294
19:03.799 --> 19:04.400
Right now,

295
19:04.640 --> 19:05.759
nobody can be trusted.

296
19:07.559 --> 19:08.079
I'll be fine.

297
19:08.559 --> 19:09.640
I'll be extra careful outside.

298
19:11.720 --> 19:13.119
You'd better not go out at all.

299
19:13.759 --> 19:14.960
Staying here is the safest.

300
19:15.279 --> 19:15.759
You hear me?

301
19:18.359 --> 19:19.400
Master, don't go out either.

302
19:19.720 --> 19:20.440
If you need anything,

303
19:20.480 --> 19:21.160
just tell me.

304
19:21.279 --> 19:21.880
I'll go get it.

305
19:22.559 --> 19:23.400
No need for you to go.

306
19:24.079 --> 19:24.960
I've got it all handled.

307
19:33.200 --> 19:33.960
Master Cheng,

308
19:35.319 --> 19:36.559
no rush, take your time.

309
19:36.759 --> 19:37.440
I'm in no hurry.

310
19:38.559 --> 19:39.559
What sauce do you want?

311
19:40.200 --> 19:41.160
Hot pepper and eggplant.

312
19:41.319 --> 19:42.240
No peppers.

313
19:42.599 --> 19:43.119
What do you have?

314
19:43.119 --> 19:43.759
Just cabbage.

315
19:43.960 --> 19:44.480
Fine.

316
19:45.759 --> 19:46.279
Hold on a bit.

317
19:54.160 --> 19:54.599
Tieping,

318
19:55.519 --> 19:56.319
what are you thinking about?

319
20:04.799 --> 20:05.400
Nothing.

320
20:07.440 --> 20:09.279
Master, what do you think of Shen Leshui?

321
20:10.279 --> 20:11.119
Whatever she's like

322
20:11.119 --> 20:11.960
is none of your business.

323
20:14.000 --> 20:15.279
Do you think she looks like a thief?

324
20:16.359 --> 20:17.759
What did I just say?

325
20:20.160 --> 20:21.160
I'm just analyzing.

326
20:22.160 --> 20:23.720
Analyzing my foot.

327
20:24.039 --> 20:25.039
Just drop it already.

328
20:25.519 --> 20:26.079
Tieping,

329
20:26.960 --> 20:28.000
let's set some ground rules.

330
20:28.839 --> 20:29.960
From now on,

331
20:30.640 --> 20:31.759
you don't leave my sight.

332
20:33.599 --> 20:34.359
You hear me?

333
20:36.880 --> 20:37.440
If you don't behave,

334
20:38.039 --> 20:38.799
I'll lock you in the back room.

335
20:42.599 --> 20:43.200
Yes, sir.

336
20:47.079 --> 20:47.759
Wash the cabbage.

337
20:52.599 --> 20:53.400
Shunzi,

338
20:54.799 --> 20:57.079
do you want thick or thin noodles?

339
20:57.640 --> 20:58.880
Whatever you pull, I'll eat.

340
20:59.519 --> 21:00.680
As long as it's hot.

341
21:01.640 --> 21:02.480
Alright.

342
21:38.839 --> 21:39.359
Master,

343
21:40.079 --> 21:40.559
have some water.

344
23:06.079 --> 23:06.799
Brother Chuang, it's me.

345
23:07.039 --> 23:07.920
It's an emergency.

346
23:08.400 --> 23:09.640
I don't know what happened to Cheng Youtian,

347
23:09.640 --> 23:10.680
but they put him in an ambulance.

348
23:11.000 --> 23:11.960
Liu Tieping is with them, too.

349
23:12.839 --> 23:13.519
Tail them.

350
23:13.839 --> 23:15.559
Got it. I'll keep you posted right away.

351
24:21.440 --> 24:22.240
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

352
24:22.279 --> 24:23.160
I'm watching him, I'm on him.

353
24:29.880 --> 24:30.680
Hey, Brother Lin.

354
24:31.160 --> 24:31.960
Tieping's gone!

355
24:31.960 --> 24:33.480
Just while we were on the phone!

356
24:40.480 --> 24:41.000
Brother Lin.

357
24:41.640 --> 24:42.319
I see him!

358
24:42.359 --> 24:43.680
Right where we crossed paths earlier.

359
24:43.839 --> 24:44.720
What the hell is wrong with you?

360
24:44.720 --> 24:45.480
He's right above my head—

361
24:45.559 --> 24:46.559
Look, isn't he right here?

362
24:49.119 --> 24:49.920
Scared the hell out of me.

363
24:50.079 --> 24:51.359
You scared the hell out of me!

364
24:51.920 --> 24:52.880
As long as he's there.

365
25:05.440 --> 25:05.960
Nurse!

366
25:06.480 --> 25:07.799
Where's the family of the patient in Bed Two?

367
25:08.000 --> 25:09.400
I only look after patients, not their families.

368
25:09.599 --> 25:11.039
Didn't he just come drop off the form?

369
25:11.440 --> 25:12.319
The form is on the counter.

370
25:13.359 --> 25:14.279
Damn it, this is bad.

371
25:14.759 --> 25:15.480
Damn it, damn it!

372
25:26.480 --> 25:26.920
See him?

373
25:27.319 --> 25:27.720
No.

374
25:30.759 --> 25:31.359
Damn it.

375
25:31.720 --> 25:32.519
Call Brother Chuang.

376
25:33.279 --> 25:34.200
Liu Tieping is gone.

377
25:39.319 --> 25:39.839
Brother Chuang!

378
25:40.319 --> 25:41.319
Liu Tieping is gone! Aren't you watching the patients?

379
25:41.519 --> 25:42.319
Where's the patient in Bed Two?

380
25:42.319 --> 25:42.960
We can't find him!

381
25:43.759 --> 25:44.799
He was just here! We only—

382
25:44.799 --> 25:45.720
We're on the first floor right now.

383
25:45.720 --> 25:47.559
The second we walked in, Liu Tieping was gone.

384
25:48.400 --> 25:49.480
His IV isn't even finished!

385
25:49.480 --> 25:50.160
We just stepped in,

386
25:50.160 --> 25:50.720
and he was gone!

387
25:52.759 --> 25:53.880
Brother Chuang, it's Xiao Gao.

388
25:54.119 --> 25:55.039
Cheng Youtian escaped too.

389
25:58.000 --> 25:59.000
Useless idiots!

390
26:00.079 --> 26:00.519
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

391
26:00.519 --> 26:01.079
Hurry up!

392
26:38.519 --> 26:40.000
Come on, a toast to Sister Tian.

393
26:40.000 --> 26:40.680
What is it?

394
26:40.680 --> 26:41.880
Come on, come on.

395
26:41.880 --> 26:43.160
Thank you, everyone. Thank you.

396
26:43.640 --> 26:44.400
To Sister Tian!

397
26:44.400 --> 26:45.559
Bottoms up, bottoms up!

398
27:33.200 --> 27:33.799
My bro's looking for you.

399
27:34.240 --> 27:35.160
I've been waiting for your word.

400
27:35.200 --> 27:36.200
What I asked you to find out...

401
27:36.319 --> 27:37.200
No news on that yet?

402
27:38.599 --> 27:39.319
What thing?

403
27:39.759 --> 27:40.559
About the meeting.

404
27:40.599 --> 27:41.200
What meeting?

405
27:41.400 --> 27:42.359
Stop playing dumb.

406
27:44.000 --> 27:44.759
I don't know anything.

407
27:45.200 --> 27:45.960
You don't know?

408
27:46.480 --> 27:47.759
You're with your master every day.

409
27:47.759 --> 27:48.279
And you don't know?

410
27:48.440 --> 27:49.720
Your master schedules all the meetings.

411
27:49.759 --> 27:50.640
You think I'm stupid?

412
27:51.200 --> 27:51.960
Spit it out.

413
27:52.839 --> 27:53.519
Bro, I...

414
27:54.039 --> 27:55.000
I really don't know.

415
27:55.079 --> 27:56.400
Nice bike you've got here.

416
27:56.960 --> 27:58.200
Get off and think carefully.

417
27:58.279 --> 27:58.799
Off you go.

418
27:59.680 --> 28:00.400
Let me take it for a spin.

419
28:00.519 --> 28:01.440
All right, bro.

420
28:03.559 --> 28:04.319
Think long and hard.

421
28:07.400 --> 28:08.079
I really don't know.

422
28:08.720 --> 28:09.000
Fine. Fine.

423
28:09.000 --> 28:09.680
Tell me right now, then.

424
28:09.720 --> 28:11.200
When's the next meeting?

425
28:11.519 --> 28:12.319
Where is it being held?

426
28:13.079 --> 28:14.359
Who's attending?

427
28:14.599 --> 28:15.079
Speak up!

428
28:15.079 --> 28:15.960
The questions I just asked you...

429
28:15.960 --> 28:16.960
Answer me!

430
28:18.440 --> 28:20.240
Bro, I really don't know what to say!

431
28:20.960 --> 28:21.960
Are you pushing your luck?

432
28:22.359 --> 28:23.680
Are you pushing your luck?

433
28:23.759 --> 28:24.839
How could you not know?

434
28:26.119 --> 28:26.960
Why aren't you talking?

435
28:27.240 --> 28:28.039
What are you doing?

436
28:28.720 --> 28:29.400
Bullying him?

437
28:32.079 --> 28:33.559
The Factory Belle is here.

438
28:35.160 --> 28:35.759
What are you yelling for?

439
28:35.759 --> 28:36.519
Just asking a few questions.

440
28:38.079 --> 28:39.079
All of you together...

441
28:39.079 --> 28:40.240
...ganging up on him?

442
28:40.599 --> 28:41.519
Aren't you ashamed of yourselves?

443
28:41.720 --> 28:42.839
Sis, don't bother with them.

444
28:43.279 --> 28:44.519
Get out of the way!

445
28:44.599 --> 28:45.519
Let him go!

446
28:45.519 --> 28:46.480
Sis, don't worry about me.

447
28:46.559 --> 28:47.279
Just go!

448
28:47.960 --> 28:48.599
Shut up!

449
28:49.160 --> 28:50.559
Wait, aren't you two in different workshops?

450
28:50.880 --> 28:51.759
What's the deal between you two?

451
28:51.759 --> 28:52.519
Let him go!

452
28:53.000 --> 28:53.960
Is there no law anymore?

453
28:54.319 --> 28:54.960
The law?

454
28:55.079 --> 28:55.839
What the hell is the law?

455
28:56.039 --> 28:56.960
Sis, stay out of this.

456
28:56.960 --> 28:57.319
Shut up!

457
28:57.319 --> 28:58.079
Just leave, sis.

458
28:58.559 --> 28:59.160
Get out of here, quick!

459
29:00.039 --> 29:01.480
Can one of you explain this?

460
29:01.519 --> 29:02.759
What's really going on with you two?

461
29:03.039 --> 29:04.119
If you want something, come at me!

462
29:04.720 --> 29:06.160
You actually bagged the Factory Belle?

463
29:07.079 --> 29:08.160
Care to explain that?

464
29:08.480 --> 29:09.759
You nailed the Factory Belle?

465
29:09.880 --> 29:11.039
You nailed the Factory Belle?

466
29:11.119 --> 29:11.759
You nailed the Factory...

467
29:11.759 --> 29:12.240
Sis, go!

468
29:12.240 --> 29:12.880
You nailed the Factory...

469
29:12.960 --> 29:13.680
Go, sis!

470
29:13.680 --> 29:14.480
I'm talking to you!

471
29:17.240 --> 29:17.759
Still want a piece of me?

472
29:18.039 --> 29:19.039
You nailed the Factory Belle?

473
29:19.039 --> 29:20.039
You nailed the Factory Belle?

474
29:21.119 --> 29:21.839
Get lost!

475
29:27.000 --> 29:28.039
Out of the way! Move!

476
29:28.079 --> 29:29.839
Hitting people, huh?! Take that!

477
29:29.839 --> 29:31.000
That's for picking on people!

478
29:31.039 --> 29:32.200
Move! Get out of the way!

479
29:32.240 --> 29:32.759
Move!

480
29:32.799 --> 29:33.960
I told you to back off!

481
29:34.240 --> 29:35.039
Picking on people!

482
29:35.240 --> 29:36.000
Move!

483
29:36.519 --> 29:37.519
That'll teach you to bully people!

484
29:38.400 --> 29:39.680
Picking on an honest man, are you?!

485
29:40.279 --> 29:40.960
Stop!

486
29:41.400 --> 29:42.200
Stop, stop, stop!

487
29:42.759 --> 29:43.839
Listen to me!

488
29:44.000 --> 29:45.759
The folks at the plant haven't clocked out yet!

489
29:46.039 --> 29:47.000
I'm calling for help!

490
29:47.480 --> 29:48.839
Think you can push honest folks around?!

491
29:48.960 --> 29:49.480
Back off!

492
29:49.480 --> 29:49.960
Don't move!

493
29:49.960 --> 29:50.680
Out of the way!

494
29:50.799 --> 29:51.680
Help!

495
29:52.079 --> 29:53.039
Somebody help!

496
29:53.119 --> 29:54.359
Try bullying him again!

497
29:54.480 --> 29:55.160
Help!

498
29:55.160 --> 29:56.039
What's your problem?! Get lost!

499
29:58.599 --> 29:59.160
What's going on?

500
30:00.160 --> 30:00.559
You...

501
30:00.839 --> 30:01.240
What do you want?

502
30:01.680 --> 30:02.119
Get the hell out of here!

503
30:02.119 --> 30:02.960
Just you wait!

504
30:03.960 --> 30:04.720
Don't run!

505
30:06.039 --> 30:06.799
Let's go!

506
30:10.440 --> 30:11.880
Sis, are you okay?

507
30:13.240 --> 30:14.000
I'm fine.

508
30:14.640 --> 30:15.400
How about you?

509
30:15.880 --> 30:16.720
I'm okay, Sis.

510
30:18.960 --> 30:19.640
Sis is here.

511
30:20.079 --> 30:20.720
Don't be scared.

512
30:44.200 --> 30:46.000
I hate bullies who pick on the weak.

513
30:52.480 --> 30:53.279
Sis, just you wait.

514
30:54.839 --> 30:55.720
One of these days,

515
30:56.119 --> 30:57.799
I'll show everyone who messes with us...

516
30:57.799 --> 30:58.880
...what I'm really made of.

517
31:02.359 --> 31:04.039
Why didn't you tell your master?

518
31:04.640 --> 31:05.799
I'm a grown man.

519
31:07.119 --> 31:08.960
Telling him would be embarrassing.

520
31:10.359 --> 31:12.240
If I hadn't run into you today,

521
31:12.559 --> 31:13.480
what would you have done alone?

522
31:13.640 --> 31:14.519
There were so many of them.

523
31:20.720 --> 31:21.519
So what?

524
31:23.640 --> 31:25.279
Even if they beat me to death, I'd never talk.

525
31:29.039 --> 31:30.200
What a stubborn fool.

526
31:32.240 --> 31:34.240
Does it still hurt? Are you injured anywhere?

527
31:34.960 --> 31:35.880
A bunch of bastards. I'm fine.

528
31:36.039 --> 31:37.160
They really beat you up bad.

529
31:41.279 --> 31:42.240
What are you laughing at?

530
31:46.519 --> 31:47.599
You're still laughing?

531
31:48.640 --> 31:49.720
Did they knock you silly?

532
31:50.240 --> 31:50.839
No, Sis.

533
31:51.440 --> 31:52.119
I was just thinking...

534
31:52.839 --> 31:53.519
Well...

535
31:54.119 --> 31:54.880
Usually,

536
31:55.319 --> 31:57.400
you seem so delicate and frail.

537
31:58.440 --> 32:00.960
That heavy vintage bicycle weighs a ton.

538
32:01.519 --> 32:02.079
Yet you, Sis...

539
32:02.079 --> 32:03.599
...swung it around just like that!

540
32:03.880 --> 32:05.680
You should've seen how terrified Brother Lei was.

541
32:05.960 --> 32:07.200
He stumbled backward in panic!

542
32:07.440 --> 32:09.160
I wasn't thinking at all back then.

543
32:09.880 --> 32:10.400
I don't even know...

544
32:10.400 --> 32:11.799
...where I got all that strength.

545
32:40.400 --> 32:40.880
All right.

546
32:41.160 --> 32:42.119
Head on back now.

547
32:42.720 --> 32:43.960
I live right around here.

548
32:44.039 --> 32:45.079
I'll just walk back in a bit.

549
32:49.799 --> 32:50.240
Sis...

550
32:50.240 --> 32:51.519
How about... How about I walk you up?

551
32:51.880 --> 32:52.400
No need.

552
32:52.599 --> 32:53.519
I'll make a phone call.

553
32:57.559 --> 32:57.960
Look,

554
32:58.680 --> 32:59.359
it's so late.

555
32:59.359 --> 33:00.200
Who could you call

556
33:00.200 --> 33:00.960
that'd even pick up?

557
33:02.119 --> 33:03.279
Stay out of it, kid.

558
33:03.720 --> 33:04.400
Head on home.

559
33:05.319 --> 33:05.880
Go on, hurry up.

560
33:12.480 --> 33:13.440
Take it easy on your bike.

561
33:14.079 --> 33:14.680
Be careful.

562
33:21.160 --> 33:22.400
Sis, get home soon, all right?

563
33:37.559 --> 33:38.039
Tieping,

564
33:38.160 --> 33:39.119
don't be scared.

565
33:39.440 --> 33:40.160
Whatever they ask you,

566
33:40.160 --> 33:41.519
just say you don't know, and that's it.

567
33:43.960 --> 33:44.559
Director,

568
33:44.680 --> 33:46.799
you should find our Tieping a girlfriend.

569
33:47.240 --> 33:47.519
Yeah.

570
33:47.519 --> 33:48.440
That's not my job.

571
33:49.319 --> 33:50.279
If he's got what it takes,

572
33:50.480 --> 33:51.200
he can find one himself.

573
33:52.160 --> 33:52.880
He's not getting any younger.

574
33:52.880 --> 33:53.720
What, can't you pull a girl?

575
33:54.079 --> 33:54.680
Get outta here, honestly...

576
33:54.960 --> 33:56.200
I'm still a bachelor myself.

577
33:56.240 --> 33:57.359
How could I look after him?

578
33:58.640 --> 33:59.640
Tieping, look who's here!

579
33:59.640 --> 34:00.839
Are you sneaking around behind Master's back

580
34:00.880 --> 34:02.200
dating someone from the workshop?

581
34:03.200 --> 34:03.559
No.

582
34:03.559 --> 34:04.200
The Factory Belle is here!

583
34:06.039 --> 34:06.839
Director! Director!

584
34:07.200 --> 34:08.679
Liu Xuemei is a fine woman.

585
34:08.800 --> 34:09.760
She's raising a kid on her own,

586
34:10.360 --> 34:11.920
and your wife took off with your daughter.

587
34:12.000 --> 34:12.639
Why don't—

588
34:12.840 --> 34:13.880
Why don't you two just get together?

589
34:14.039 --> 34:14.719
Stop talking nonsense!

590
34:15.159 --> 34:15.920
She doesn't feel that way.

591
34:16.440 --> 34:17.559
Right, don't talk rubbish.

592
34:17.719 --> 34:18.800
My master didn't mean that.

593
34:18.840 --> 34:19.800
Xuemei... You punk!

594
34:21.360 --> 34:22.159
It's pretty late.

595
34:22.320 --> 34:23.679
Let Tieping walk you back.

596
34:24.000 --> 34:24.440
No need.

597
34:26.840 --> 34:27.960
Chop-chop, hurry up!

598
34:30.079 --> 34:31.320
Director, you're such a wimp.

599
34:31.320 --> 34:32.079
Go after her!

600
34:32.360 --> 34:33.440
What are you babbling about?

601
34:33.840 --> 34:34.360
Go after her!

602
34:34.599 --> 34:35.039
Tieping,

603
34:35.039 --> 34:36.079
make sure she gets all the way home!

604
35:27.519 --> 35:28.239
Are you okay, Sis?

605
35:29.639 --> 35:30.199
I'm fine.

606
35:30.920 --> 35:32.000
Sis, we have to wait a bit for the train.

607
35:34.760 --> 35:36.119
Does your head wound still hurt?

608
35:37.440 --> 35:38.119
Not anymore.

609
35:38.760 --> 35:39.519
Um...

610
35:39.760 --> 35:40.480
The doctor said...

611
35:40.519 --> 35:41.440
...it might...

612
35:41.519 --> 35:42.159
...leave a scar.

613
35:43.000 --> 35:43.960
A scar doesn't matter.

614
35:44.280 --> 35:45.199
I look sharp anyway.

615
36:05.920 --> 36:06.639
Sis, put it on.

616
36:07.280 --> 36:07.760
No need.

617
36:07.920 --> 36:08.559
I'm not cold.

618
36:08.760 --> 36:09.679
Just put it on.

619
36:09.840 --> 36:11.000
No, you keep it on.

620
36:11.920 --> 36:12.360
Come on, Sis.

621
36:12.480 --> 36:13.239
Put it on.

622
36:13.639 --> 36:14.559
No need to be polite with me.

623
36:15.079 --> 36:15.639
Put it on.

624
36:19.199 --> 36:19.760
Thanks.

625
37:26.960 --> 37:27.880
She hates the cold.

626
37:29.320 --> 37:30.559
She must be so cold.

627
40:05.880 --> 40:06.440
Any luck?

628
40:06.599 --> 40:07.079
Brother Chuang.

629
40:07.320 --> 40:08.760
We checked all the cameras by the intersection.

630
40:08.760 --> 40:09.199
Nothing.

631
40:11.199 --> 40:11.760
Brother Chuang.

632
40:12.039 --> 40:13.320
We searched the entire neighborhood.

633
40:13.559 --> 40:14.639
Checked the cameras around his place too.

634
40:14.760 --> 40:15.719
There's no sign of him at all.

635
40:16.559 --> 40:18.480
If he's out to avenge Liu Xuemei,

636
40:18.480 --> 40:19.199
his next target...

637
40:19.199 --> 40:21.079
is bound to be someone tied to that old auction.

638
40:21.519 --> 40:22.440
The ones on that list.

639
40:24.280 --> 40:25.079
Right now,

640
40:25.480 --> 40:26.960
contact everyone on the list.

641
40:27.039 --> 40:27.519
Split up.

642
40:28.360 --> 40:28.800
Got it, let's go.

643
40:31.679 --> 40:32.519
Is this Tu Chunyan?

644
40:33.159 --> 40:34.239
This is Gao Xuelin from Criminal Investigation.

645
40:34.400 --> 40:35.119
Are you home?

646
40:35.960 --> 40:37.480
Good. Don't go anywhere today.

647
40:38.119 --> 40:38.760
No matter who comes knocking,

648
40:38.760 --> 40:39.480
don't open the door.

649
40:39.519 --> 40:40.719
Call me if anything happens.

650
40:41.840 --> 40:42.440
All right.

651
40:42.639 --> 40:43.199
Talk soon.

652
40:46.840 --> 40:48.440
Have Liu Tieping and Cheng Youtian come by your place?

653
40:49.480 --> 40:50.159
No, they haven't.

654
40:50.559 --> 40:50.840
Look,

655
40:50.880 --> 40:52.480
the two of them never come here.

656
40:52.760 --> 40:53.760
There's a high chance you could be

657
40:53.760 --> 40:55.280
the killer's next target.

658
40:55.559 --> 40:56.000
Say what?

659
40:56.440 --> 40:57.519
I said there's a chance.

660
40:58.000 --> 40:59.159
We'll send someone to protect you.

661
41:00.119 --> 41:01.719
Be extra careful when you're out and about.

662
41:01.960 --> 41:03.000
Actually, it's best if you don't go out at all.

663
41:03.800 --> 41:05.440
If you hear from them, let me know immediately.

664
41:05.559 --> 41:06.119
Got it?

665
41:07.039 --> 41:07.360
All right.

666
41:07.360 --> 41:07.840
Did you get through?

667
41:07.840 --> 41:08.320
No.

668
41:09.639 --> 41:09.960
What...

669
41:10.360 --> 41:11.199
What's going on here?

670
41:55.599 --> 41:56.239
Liu Xiaosheng.

671
42:01.360 --> 42:02.079
I know

672
42:03.039 --> 42:04.599
the night your mother died,

673
42:04.960 --> 42:06.000
you were with her.

674
42:08.800 --> 42:09.519
How do you know?

675
42:10.239 --> 42:11.239
You weren't even there.

676
42:18.599 --> 42:19.639
The next morning,

677
42:20.079 --> 42:21.039
I went to the scene

678
42:22.280 --> 42:23.760
and photographed this under a bench.

679
42:25.199 --> 42:26.840
This glove has "Sheng" stitched on it.

680
42:27.960 --> 42:29.480
Your mother knitted it for you, didn't she?

681
42:33.119 --> 42:34.079
Ten thousand to touch.

682
42:35.199 --> 42:36.440
What... What about a kiss?

683
42:36.440 --> 42:37.079
Twenty thousand.

684
42:37.320 --> 42:37.880
Let me have a kiss.

685
42:37.880 --> 42:38.280
Come here.

686
42:41.039 --> 42:41.760
I really want to

687
42:42.440 --> 42:43.199
smack you to death.

688
42:44.440 --> 42:46.119
I never thought you'd be the one who stole the money.

689
42:46.519 --> 42:48.360
You're cut from the same cloth as Ma Guowen.

690
42:48.360 --> 42:49.440
I swear I didn't take that money.

691
42:50.000 --> 42:50.559
Damn it.
